| `tools/exp05_params.py` (new; experiment-owned — `model/xRIR_cyl.py` is a member of exp_03's pinned closure and is NOT edited) | `build_tier(backbone, tier)` mapping S/M/L to the registered kwargs of `build_xrir` (which already accepts `dim/depth/heads/mlp_dim`); `count_parameters(model)` → exact integers `{"encoder", "full", "trainable" (requires_grad), "non_encoder"}` | the exact counts of §2 reproduced; the matching tolerance ≤ 0.5 % asserted per tier; `dim_head` = 64 kept; token count 256 (the `lin_proj_0` assertion holds for every tier) |
